message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "PPO-GAT: Container Stacking Benchmark and Results"
abstract: >-
  Held-out benchmark instances and complete per-run experimental results for
  the yard-level container stacking problem, accompanying the IEEE Access
  paper on graph-structured deep reinforcement learning with a per-node
  policy (PPO-GAT).
